# AI Client Onboarding Automation (n8n)

## Overview

This project automates the client onboarding process using n8n, AI, and Gmail.

When a client submits a form:

- Generates a personalized welcome email using AI.
- Sends the welcome email automatically.
- Generates a professional Terms & Conditions email.
- Sends the Terms & Conditions email automatically.
- Uses AI to personalize email content based on customer information.

## Workflow

Form Submission
↓
Edit Fields
↓
AI Agent (Welcome Email)
↓
JavaScript Code
↓
Gmail

AND

Form Submission
↓
Edit Fields
↓
AI Agent (Terms & Conditions)
↓
JavaScript Code
↓
Gmail

## Technologies

- n8n
- Groq AI / LLM
- Gmail API
- JavaScript
- JSON

## Features

- Automated client onboarding
- Personalized AI-generated welcome emails
- Automated Terms & Conditions email
- JSON parsing
- Dynamic customer data
- No manual email writing

## Requirements

- n8n
- Groq API Key
- Gmail Credentials

